From 848304365c14ba3eb1fc640ee75b01ed6958abcf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Hansen <mike@rhasspy.org>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:46:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add native duplex voice calls with bounded direct I2S
 playback

Add standalone voice_call, activation-scoped native messages, microphone and wake-word integration, truthful I2S completion tracking, and a stock Voice Preview Edition call-only configuration.

Co-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
